From 910826e4858624d05074c4cb03c02263ca0486ad Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: faycal <faycalelhandi9@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 20:20:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 26/35] feat(hybrid): opt-in NVIDIA low-latency mode through
 VK_NV_low_latency2

ASTROHYBRID_LOW_LATENCY=1|measure (default off). Enables the extension
and present IDs when the device reports both, sets the swapchain's
low-latency sleep mode, ends each guest frame at the DCB submission
carrying its flip with the driver's latency sleep, numbers frames by
flip so simulation, render-submit and present markers line up, and
prints the driver's own per-frame reports every 10 s. measure keeps the
markers and reports with the mode off.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
